# UniFi Protect MCP

Go MCP server for UniFi Protect.

Cursor uses `.cursor/rules/` (this file + org common). Copilot instructions under `.github/` remain for other tools.

## Conventions

- Prefer env / `.env.example` for NVR URL and API keys
- Keep tool handlers thin; share Protect client code
- Do not commit live credentials or camera/site secrets
